\begin_layout Problem
Let 
\begin_inset Formula $\succsim$
\end_inset

 be a binary relation on a set 
\begin_inset Formula $X$
\end_inset

.
 Prove that if 
\begin_inset Formula $\succsim$
\end_inset

 is complete and transitive, then for each 
\begin_inset Formula $B\subseteq X$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $B\neq\emptyset$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $C^{\succsim}(B)=C^{\succ}(B)$
\end_inset

.
